### ============================================================
### Tests API Membre 6 - extension VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Lancez `php artisan serve` puis cliquez sur "Send Request"
### ============================================================

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. Connexion (adaptez la route du Membre 1)
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "email": "aicha.nguema@etudiant.cm", "password": "password" }

###
@token = {{$dotenv BILLING_HTTP_TOKEN}}
@admin = {{$dotenv BILLING_ADMIN_TOKEN}}
### Les jetons sont fournis par le fichier .env local, jamais stockes dans ce fichier.

### ---------------------- ETUDIANT ----------------------

### Catalogue des offres (public)
GET {{base}}/plans
Accept: application/json

### Mon abonnement + solde
GET {{base}}/billing/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Historique de mes abonnements
GET {{base}}/billing/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Souscrire a l'offre Premium (id 3)
POST {{base}}/billing/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plan_id": 3, "mode_paiement": "mobile_money", "transaction_id": "TX-0001" }

### Annuler mon abonnement
POST {{base}}/billing/subscription/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Solde de tokens
GET {{base}}/billing/tokens/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Historique des tokens (filtre optionnel ?type=generation)
GET {{base}}/billing/tokens/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consommation par rapport
GET {{base}}/billing/tokens/by-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------- ADMIN ----------------------

### Toutes les offres
GET {{base}}/admin/billing/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

### Creer une offre
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Etudiant+", "description": "Offre intermediaire", "prix": 9.90, "tokens_inclus": 50000, "duree_jours": 30, "actif": true }

### Corriger le prix de Premium (id 3)
PUT {{base}}/admin/billing/plans/3
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prix": 49.90 }

### Desactiver / supprimer une offre
DELETE {{base}}/admin/billing/plans/4
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

### Liste des abonnements (filtres : statut, plan_id, q)
GET {{base}}/admin/billing/subscriptions?statut=actif
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

### Detail d'un abonnement
GET {{base}}/admin/billing/subscriptions/2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirmer le paiement d'un abonnement en attente
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/subscriptions/5/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transaction_id": "TX-0001" }

### Suspendre / reactiver / annuler
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/subscriptions/2/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/subscriptions/2/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/subscriptions/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

### Attribuer une offre a un utilisateur (user 3, plan Pro)
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/users/3/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plan_id": 2 }

### Solde + historique d'un utilisateur
GET {{base}}/admin/billing/users/2/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json

### Recharge manuelle
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/users/2/tokens/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantite": 20000, "description": "Geste commercial" }

### Ajustement (positif ou negatif)
POST {{base}}/admin/billing/users/2/tokens/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantite": -500, "description": "Correction d'une erreur" }

### Statistiques
GET {{base}}/admin/billing/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Accept: application/json
